                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game isn't fun. It's a tired concept for a puzzle game that you could find on pretty much any flash game site. The game constantly lags and is plagued with graphical glitches. As if that weren't enough, I couldn't beat the first level because the game crashes before I can get halfway through it. I see nothing good about this game. It wouldn't even keep a small child entertained because it crashes so frequently.\nEven if the developer fixed the awful glitches and crashes, the game still wouldn't be that fun, it's just too simplistic and easy, with no real substance.\n\nThis game wouldn't be worth the price if it were free, but $5? That's absolutely outrageous. I got this in a humble bundle or something, so I didn't pay anything for it, but I'm honestly ashamed to have this in my library.",
